<title>USA: TABLE-Biodynamics Q3 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Biodynamics Q3 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biodynamics International Inc</p>
<p>					Three Months     Nine Months</p>
<p>				     Ended June 30    Ended June 30</p>
<p>			     1997	1996	  1997	  1996</p>
<p>					(Unaudited)	(Unaudited)</p>
<p> Revenues		 $2,082   $3,184	 $6,706     $8,722</p>
<p> Net Loss		(1,468)    (572)	(3,175)    (1,995)</p>
<p> Net Loss Per Share   (0.17)   (0.07)	 (0.38)     (0.25)</p>
<p>			(in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: -- Co says results were impacted by the Japanese Ministry of Health's banning the use of human dura mater tissue and ordering a product recall in response to a recommendation from the United Nations World Health Organization.  As a result, the company says, it charged year-to-date results with gross margin reserves of approximately $450,000 for current year revenues and $551,000 for prior year revenues.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1700))</p>
